Files are unchanged upstream bytes. db2010-audio-codec.c selects scalar
MINIMP3_NO_SIMD and MINIMP3_ONLY_MP3, guards the exercised MPEG1/L3 320kbps,
48kHz stereo format, and decodes complete 960-byte frames across guest packets.
This is host processing behind recovered ARM-visible contracts; no DSP ISA,
handset filter, analog route or acoustic equivalence is claimed.

Decoder history is explicitly serialized field by field in native checkpoint8;
no host pointer or raw padded C structure is stored. Deterministic comparisons
require the sealed matching engine/build. Live presentation is separate work.
